这是我们称之为“海块”（sea block）的环节。

00:48:38.960 --> 00:48:41.119
This is the haunted sea block.
这是闹鬼的“海块”。

00:48:41.119 --> 00:48:43.119
I like that, Alec.
我喜欢这个，Alec。

00:48:43.119 --> 00:48:46.440
The sea block.
“海块”。

00:48:46.440 --> 00:48:47.440
We love the girl.
我们爱这个女孩。

00:48:47.440 --> 00:48:53.159
I just have a girl named the sea block.
我只是有个叫“海块”的女孩。

00:48:53.159 --> 00:48:58.800
We love hearing from fans of the show listeners of this podcast.
我们喜欢听取本节目粉丝和播客听众的反馈。

00:48:58.800 --> 00:49:15.679
If you would like to record a voice note and to tell us about your experience, your love of your relationship with how I met your mother or our podcast, how we made your mother, go to how we made your mother.com, go up to contact, follow the directions.
如果你想录制一段语音留言，告诉我们你的经历，或者你对《老爸老妈浪漫史》或我们的播客《我们是如何制作老爸老妈浪漫史的》的喜爱之情，请访问 howwemadeyourmother.com，点击“联系我们”，并按照说明操作。

